We had been together for almost 3 years, and she left me last year. Whenever I think of her, I feel so sad and want to leave this world. She is the first woman in my life, and she left me with a shadow and pain that I have not been able to get over.
When I bought this phone, I thought of two things at the time: we can share the same misery, but now I can't help but feel regretful. Life is like this, some people you don't want to meet for the rest of your life, and some things you don't want to know. But what can you do?
I have been thinking of her every time I see the Samsung phone. The pain is so deep that it fills my whole body. I have never spent more than 2,000 yuan on a phone, but I didn't hesitate to buy it for her. Even if she is the best person, but if she changes her mind, all the promises and oaths will be meaningless.
