The gameplay is good, and the portability is better than the PS4.
I already bought The Legend of Zelda; I'll wait for the game and try it out next time.
Value for money is very high.
I've used it three or four times already.
1. The package is in good condition.
2. It is very simple to use and easy to clean.
3. You can DIY haircut, which is more cost-effective.
In summary, it was a very successful purchase.
The toy quality is good; I'll give you some feedback on its packaging.
I received the package yesterday, which was sent by Amazon and marked EMS. The last one was delivered by Tmall's express. How many bends did it take? Is the relationship between Amazon and Tmall still good?
And on packaging, it was wrapped in cling film several times and there were no plastic bubble paper inside; when opened up, all the parts were placed in an empty box, fortunately the toy quality is good with no broken pieces, but much smaller than expected because it's not powered, often derailing when pushed around, feeling that the track gaps are too large and the design is unreasonable.
The goods are good.
Firstly, I would like to say that I noticed a price drop just a few days after purchasing it, and received a negative review. However, I still consider it quite good overall, with high value for money, sufficient CPU and GPU performance to handle mainstream online games and most of the larger single-player titles. The cooling system is excellent, but there's a minor issue with screen leakage (a common problem with IPS screens). The audio quality isn't great, and the hard drive seems subpar (I recommend adding an SSD yourself). After taking the computer to the service center yesterday for hardware inspection, everything was found to be in perfect condition. The built-in Windows 8.1 version wasn't very user-friendly, so upgrading to Windows 10 would be recommended. The seller shipped quickly, and all my inquiries were answered promptly. The invoice arrived two days after receiving the computer, which was satisfactory. Unfortunately, there weren't any gift items included.
(I would like to add that when buying a keyboard cover, do not buy it from a shop called E cool Digital Center on Tmall. The delivery is slow, the quality is bad, and the product is not returned or exchanged if there is a problem. The boss also talks a lot of dirty words. I would like to expose it specially)
Scoundrel!
At the time of purchase, it was said on the activity page that you would receive "Three Body Complete Works" for every 99 yuan spent. Upon receiving the goods, there was no such gift. When calling customer service to ask about this issue, they asked if we could show them screenshots from the original activity page. Who bought the items and then saved the web page screenshot? Isn't it your own activity where customers should provide evidence themselves next time?各位买家，请务必注意保存好相关证据。
I want to tell everyone not to waste money.
Firstly, I was eagerly anticipating purchasing and thought that all of the products from the Aroma brand would not be too bad. After receiving them, I found the packaging to be decent enough, with an acceptable size. However, one box out of every few had mostly soft pieces, which were difficult to detect visually but could be felt when touched. When tasted, there was no discernible flavor; it was bland and tasteless. The fruit flesh around the core turned dark yellow after being bitten, indicating that they were defective in quality. Only about one-third of the items were actually consumable, so I strongly advise against buying them. They are also quite expensive for such poor quality!
A Lesson Learned: I'll Never Buy Fruits on E-commerce Again!
The quality of the images is unacceptable.
As a title for an ancient map collection, the book is unacceptable in its selection, type and printing of images, some of which are even mosaic-like, blurry and unrecognizable.
Even if this book is not a professional atlas, even if it is a small-sized illustration, it should be worthy of the abundant ancient Chinese materials left by our ancestors in the index!
And, after all, many of the images are available from the relevant industry resources in a clear original file, so what is the difference between using an image and not using an image?
I am sorry for this kind of academic spirit.
On matters of writing, no opinion is offered; each has his own discernment.
2 stars overall.
Good shopping
Great product!
I still believe in Amazon’s own products; now that we can buy overseas, it is convenient to get things shipped back from abroad and the shipping time is just a few days longer than domestic shipments. I have no doubt about Amazon’s ability to clear customs for us when buying overseas goods, which is much faster than going through a third-party carrier. Therefore, many people are turning to Amazon’s Overseas Shopping service to purchase items online.
I hope the quality and price of domestic products will be better, and many things are made in China, but when we go out and buy them back, they are cheaper than in China, so I hope they will improve.
Buy second-hand ones that have been opened.
The tax on more than 300 machines is quite high indeed, and the balance is better now that there are more than 600 machines.
The seal was broken when I received it, and it looked like it had been opened before, so I took a picture of it right away. It turned out that the seal was opened, and the paperboard inside was damaged. I was worried that it was returned by someone else, and I didn't want to wait until the anniversary to try it out. Fortunately, the machine didn't have any electricity, and there was no hair in the blade. Otherwise, I would have to go a long way to return it!
It is not known whether it will work well or if there might be any problems in the short term. As with previous reviews, items that were shipped when out of stock turned out to be unreliable!
Overall satisfaction
Previously I was worried about the camera's packaging; this time it turned out to be better. There is an airbag inside, and the three codes of the camera match up, so you can register on the official website. The shutter count is zero, but everything else will have to wait for time to test.
The delivery speed is quite fast. I complained about the express courier here. The valuable goods were put in the doorway, and he ran very fast. I couldn't open the box in front of him to check it. I was speechless.
Too small; no umbrella cover; average material.
It's not a big number at all!
Second Totes, 1. This one has no umbrella cover. 2. The handle material is average. 3. It clearly says Large, but it's actually meant for one person and won't be enough for two people.
I bought one in the US, and it can be used by three people without any pressure.
The product is good, but Amazon's after-sales service is really worse than other websites
After placing the order, I found that I had made a mistake, but I couldn't cancel the order. The error page of the online customer service showed an error link, and I couldn't contact it.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When I applied for return, I was told that food items cannot be returned once they are signed for. I could not call Amazon customer service, and they said the same thing.
I have bought non-returnable items on JD.com and Suning before, including milk and diapers, and contacted the customer service to get them returned. The diapers opened after they were delivered smelled too bad, but the customer service still gave me a refund. On Amazon, you can't get a refund for non-returnable items.
The rules are dead, people are alive, how should we handle this? Contact our customer service department.
Tell me, I can either collect it myself or let the courier buy it himself, it would have been difficult for the courier to do so, why do I let the courier make money to buy something that I don't buy?
I'm not going to back down, I'm going to take it myself, but I have to give you a credit for your service.
The headphones are too loud and there is noise.
This earphone is really trash, I don't know if it's my ears that are the problem or if the earphone is really not as good as it used to be.
I bought a blue one two years ago on a website, and the sound quality was not bad, without any noise and the bass was also good, I used it for two years and a half, and I am going to buy another one (Urbeats). After all, it feels good.
I bought a purple one, which is quite good looking, but when I opened it today, I found that the sound was not right. The sound was either too loud or too soft.
I thought it was just the sound effects of that song and didn't give much thought to it at first, but after listening for hours I realized this problem was quite serious. Not only were there off-key notes, but also poor bass quality compared to what I had heard before. There were some additional noises, is it possible that only my purple headphones have this issue? Or could it be that the headphone manufacturing process has indeed fallen short?
A very poor rating, I'm very disappointed.
The return must be made by noon tomorrow.
PS looks good
Amazon should not sell this kind of product
I bought it at a discounted price, and the price is not low. The comments are also very good.
When I actually received the product, I was shocked. The product was scratched all over, and there were scratches on other parts of the product. It was not a defective product or a second-hand product. I will post a picture later.
I asked for a refund, the manufacturer saw the picture and said it was transportation, isn't that a blunder?
How can the goods be worn out inside?
There are only two possibilities: either it is a defective or a used product, or I deliberately damaged the product and then returned it.
Objectively, I have no proof that I did not damage the product, but based on my credit history of shopping on Amazon, I think that such an item should not be in Amazon's self-service, the customer chooses Amazon is trust, customer win, we win, the customer's victory is the manufacturer's victory, hope you all work together to improve, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate and within acceptable error limits; it comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate inside the box, and the 12-word mark on the dial is genuine diamond. It fits well for personal use, and as a gift, it adds to one's prestige.
The Bentley is really good.
Things are good.
The goods are really good, I sent it to my girlfriend. However, I was not very happy in the afternoon. The logistics company directly put the package in the parcel box and did not send the verification short message to me, so I ran two times.
But the baby is really cute.
Original one, packaging is good
The packaging is complete, with an inflatable bag inside, and there are no online reviews, only a glowing look of a product.
The bottle is also packed with a plastic film, just like the picture, and the delivery was quick, the next day after the photo was taken.
It's genuine; just out of stock at the moment and not sure when it will be back in stock.
Looks like a beautiful place.
I have been eyeing this camera for a long time, but I didn't buy it because of the price and other reasons. This time, I bought it because of the free shipping and the price is still acceptable.
After I bought it, there were no problems with other things, but when I connected the software, I couldn't connect it. My router is TP, and I searched the Internet and found that many people had this problem. I spent two hours to change the settings of the router, and finally I used 360WIFI as a medium to make it work. I called the Mi customer service and they didn't have any solutions to this problem. They just told me to contact Amazon for after-sales service.
Another thing to note is that I saw online user comments that the minimum storage card supported by this camera is 8G, and smaller storage capacity will not be recognized, so please note this.
It feels good to use it, but the picture quality is still acceptable, but the audio quality is very poor. The machine has some degree of heat generation, and if you keep it on for a long time, it feels like this level of heat is somewhat difficult to accept.
In conclusion, this product has many shortcomings, so please be careful when you buy it.
Lightweight and large capacity
I like it for its lightness and capacity but I find two separate compartments to be a bit excessive; I'm not sure what to put in them.
After buying it, I found that there was another brand similar one on Overseas Shopping (Meizu) for less than two hundred yuan.
Amazon shipping problems
After receiving the goods, the following was found:
1. The packaging is severely worn out.
2. The table of contents is seriously misformatted.
3. The clock does not move; the lamp cannot be charged and used, nor can it adjust time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately and can only pay for shipping to the US and then make up the fee.
5. The reason for 2 points is that the customer service is good.
When I first bought it, something was wrong, all the lights were flashing and it was not working.
To request a refund, it took three days to get the goods to Shanghai and they still haven't been delivered.
The phone calls to the delivery staff are not answered.
The courier company said they only have that contact information.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
I received a text message saying that there was no request for the delay, but the delivery was delayed anyway - this is what I received.
Then they said something about the transfer issue.
After all, the poor shopping experience has me questioning the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics and control systems.
I probably won't get it today.
